      "inner": "0<t1<1; Xa=4/Lambda with Lambda>=2^16640. Hence Xa<Xminus<Xkeep<Xcut<a^2<1<XR<IposLeft.",
      "bump": "Every normalized radial bump lies below 4. Its physical X endpoint is below 16*X0Ipos < exp(5)*X0Ipos.",
